  answer:2,
  explanation:"**The endpoint file prints this explanation:**\n\n> In adults, the most common cause of unilateral (and bilateral) proptosis is thyroid eye disease due to orbital tissue inflammation and expansion.\n\n*The expansion above this line is written for this bank; the box itself is the endpoint file’s own.*",
  objective:"Thyroid eye disease is the most common cause of unilateral (and bilateral) proptosis in adults, from orbital tissue inflammation and expansion.",
